  {
   "id": "mars-2120-154293@patch-2024-10-31",
   "gameId": "mars-2120-154293",
   "displayName": "New Patch Arrives!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-31T18:22:33.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings, Martians!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As many of you know, MARS 2120 has been our most ambitious project, and it’s been incredible to see the love and support across all platforms! We’ve been listening closely to all your feedback and suggestions, and today, we’re excited to bring you a major update to make your experience on the Red Planet even better.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here’s what’s new",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes: We implemented general improvements to fix a variety of identified bugs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Balance Adjustments: Enemy and boss difficulty has been fine-tuned to provide a fairer and more challenging experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Localization Enhancements: We reviewed translations across all languages for better cultural adaptation and accuracy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Map Adjustments: General updates were made to improve map navigation and visibility.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Collision Fixes: We refined object collisions across environments to improve interaction and enhance realism.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Experience Orb Colors: Updated the colors of experience orbs for improved distinction and visibility during gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Door and Secret Wall Interaction: The character can now open doors and break secret walls by striking them, adding more versatility to exploration.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Fire Interactions: You can now burn vines using a wider variety of fire attacks, adding more tactical options to gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Delete Saves: It’s now possible to delete individual saves from each slot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tutorial Screen: A new tutorial screen is available in both the pause and main menus, making helpful game information easily accessible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Audiolog Screen: We’ve added an audiolog screen in the pause and main menus, allowing you to revisit recordings found in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re grateful to everyone who has joined us on this journey so far. We’ll keep working to ensure MARS 2120 is an unforgettable experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you on Mars! 🚀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
